(36796, 'ptBR', 'The Flock''s Revenge', 'Kill 18 Bloodmane Saberon.', 'The Bloodmane took several of our initiates when they ambushed our ritual in Ravenskar. They must be taught that the flock will never allow such a deed to go unpunished!$b$bWe will kill one of their tribe for each of the flock that has fallen!$b$bhead into their accursed home of Bloodmane Valley and slaughter as many of them as you can find.', '', '', '', '', '', 'Return to High Ravenspeaker Krikka within the Nest of the Ravenspeakers.', 19865),
